    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smyth Residential are delighted to offer 51 The Station House, a beautifully presented second floor two bedroomed apartment with two balconies. This fine bright apartment boasts airy accommodation and enjoys the use of a roof garden as well. The apartment is ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nThe Waterways is a well maintained development extremely convenient to Sallins train station which is only a short stroll away. The Arrow train service will take you to the city centre in twenty five minutes. All amenities including shops, shopping centres, schools, churches, pubs, restaurants and crèches are within walking distance. There is a SuperValu, post office and pharmacy in the Waterways complex. Naas town centre is 4km away. Country walks can be enjoyed along the banks of the Grand Canal and local landmarks include Naas golf club and Sallins GAA.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to 78 square meters and comprises entrance hallway, lounge, kitchen, two bedrooms, utility room and bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\n1.10m x 1.32m (3' 7\" x 4' 4\")\r\n1.14m x 6.25m (3' 9\" x 20' 6\")\r\nL-shaped. Large walk-in hotpress. Extra-wide cloakroom closet. Intercom point.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\n3.82m x 4.18m (12' 6\" x 13' 9\")\r\nPorcelain tiled floor. Wall mounted electric fire.\r\n\r\nKitchen Area\r\n3.43m x 5.61m (11' 3\" x 18' 5\")\r\nWall and base fitted units. Large area of worktop space. Stainless steel sink unit. Tiled splashback. Plumbed for dishwasher. Electrolux hob with extractor hood. Nordmende oven. Spotlights. Fitted shelf. Porcelain tiled floor. Door leading to south facing balcony.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.95m x 4.05m (9' 8\" x 13' 3\")\r\nLaminate flooring. Double fitted wardrobes. Door to balcony.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.51m x 3.00m (8' 3\" x 9' 10\")\r\nLaminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.53m x 1.83m (8' 4\" x 6' 0\")\r\nWhite wc, wash hand basin with storage and bath. Telephone shower. Generous wall tiles. Shaver light. Medicine cabinet. Wall mounted towel rack.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n1.77m x 2.32m (5' 10\" x 7' 7\")\r\nPlumbed for washing machine. Porcelain tiled floor. Area of worktop space. Fitted shelving."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Electric heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nManagement fee €2,600 p.a. \r\nTwo balconies\r\nAllocated car-parking\r\nExcellent location adjacent to train station\r\nBuilt 2005\r\nLift to second floor\r\nBER C2 No. 114811151\r\nIntercom"
